<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Dear&nbsp;{!advpm__Matter__c.advpm__Primary_Contact__c},&nbsp;</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">We recently served you with a lawsuit to collect on the debt owed to&nbsp;</span></div><div style=""><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif">{!IF(advpm__Matter__c.Originating_Lender__c == "Quick Bridge", "Quick Bridge Funding","National Funding")}.</font></span><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">This lawsuit will enable us to get a judgment against you and/or the business. Under the terms of the loan agreement we are entitled to include all attorney’s fees and costs we spend in the final judgment amount. Additionally, post judgment interest in the amount of 10% will accrue. This will only work to increase the amount of the debt owed to&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!IF(advpm__Matter__c.Originating_Lender__c == "Quick Bridge", "Quick Bridge Funding","National Funding")}</span><span style="font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">.&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">There is still time to settle this lawsuit. In order to avoid these additional fees and to prevent a judgment from being entered against you and/or your business, <b>please reach out to us within fourteen (14) days from the date of this email</b> to set up a payment plan or to arrange for a lump sum payment.&nbsp; &nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><b>Please contact us at 800-361-4094.</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;"><b>{!IF(advpm__Matter__c.Originating_Lender__c == "Quick Bridge", "Quick Bridge Funding","National Funding")}</b></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: medium; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div>{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Street__c}</div><div>{!$Setup.Company_Information__c.City__c}, {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.State__c} {!$Setup.Company_Information__c.Zip__c}</div><div><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">P: (800) 361-4094</span></div></div><div style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><br></div></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
